# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Samplomatic"
msgstr "تعليمات تثبيت أحدث إصدار من Samplomatic"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "تعليمات التثبيت"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "تعليمات التثبيت {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "المتطلبات الأساسية {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "أولًا، أنشئ بيئة بسيطة لا يوجد فيها سوى Python. نوصي باستخدام [بيئات Python الافتراضية](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "فعِّل بيئتك الجديدة.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install the packages:\n"
msgstr "هناك طريقتان أساسيتان لتثبيت الحزم:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[الخيار 1: التثبيت من PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[الخيار 2: التثبيت من المصدر](#option-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "الخيار 1: التثبيت من PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `samplomatic` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "أبسط طريقة لتثبيت الحزمة `samplomatic` هي عبر `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "الخيار 2: التثبيت من المصدر {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "إذا كنت تخطط للتطوير في المستودع أو لتشغيل الدفاتر محليًا، فعليك التثبيت من المصدر.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `samplomatic` repository.\n"
msgstr "أولًا، استنسخ مستودع `samplomatic`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "بعد ذلك، حدِّث pip وادخل إلى المستودع.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `samplomatic` to the virtual environment. If you plan to run the notebooks and their visualizations, install the notebook dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` and `vis` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "الخطوة التالية هي تثبيت `samplomatic` في البيئة الافتراضية. إذا كنت تخطط لتشغيل الدفاتر وتصوراتها المرئية، فثبّت اعتماديات الدفاتر. وإذا كنت تخطط للتطوير في المستودع، فثبّت اعتماديات `dev` و`vis`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "عدِّل الخيارات أدناه بما يناسب احتياجاتك.\n"
